        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDH193, Solid Brass Colonial Style Shutter Door Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Colonial Style Shutter Door Holder is made of solid brass. Bullet shutter catches are small enough to remain unobtrusive on your shutters. Designed to hold open window shutters, it is easy to use by simply pushing the shutter open until the bolt is secured into the catch. This 2\" long Colonial styled window shutter holder is easy to install and comes packaged with all necessary mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDH193-Specifications.gif?v=1704354769\" width=\"384\" height=\"206\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SDH193 Shutter Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDH193 Colonial Shutter Door Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Colonial Style Shutter Door Holder, Deltana SDH193",
                "description": "Bullet Shutter Catch Deltana SDH193 - The Colonial Style Shutter Door Holder is made of solid brass. Bullet shutter catches are small enough to remain unobtrusive on your shutters. Designed to hold open window shutters, it is easy to use by simply pushing the shutter open until the bolt is secured into the catch. This 2 inches long Colonial styled window shutter holder is easy to install and comes packaged with all necessary mounting hardware. ",
